      "statement": "Default token claims are issuer step-cli, audience https://ca/sign, iat/nbf now, and exp now plus DefaultValidity (5 minutes); validity is bounded by MinValidity 10s, MaxValidity 1h, and MaxValidityDelay 30 minutes.",
