      "statement": "Token options include WithRootCA (SHA-256 of the root into the sha claim), WithSANS, WithStep/WithSSH (step claim with ssh property), WithUserData (merged into the user claim), and WithConfirmationFingerprint (cnf with x5rt#S256).",
