      "statement": "TokenGenerator.Token assembles claims with a random 256-bit jti, kid, issuer, audience, optional sha root fingerprint and optional validity window, then signs with the JWK algorithm; SignToken defaults SANs to the subject and ties the token to a CSR fingerprint via the cnf claim when captured.",
